      {
        "id": "verdicts",
        "effects": [
          {
            "type": "compute",
            "fn": "court_verdicts"
          }
        ],
        "lines": [
          {
            "speaker": "narrator",
            "text": "终审。"
          },
          {
            "speaker": "eluen",
            "text": "我不必被选中。……让我以无名者的身份，在他们中间走一年。然后我离开。",
            "when": "verdict.eluen == voluntary"
          },
          {
            "speaker": "narrator",
            "text": "艾琉恩被判离手。她最后一个起身，在门槛上回头看了一眼庭镜里的城市。",
            "when": "verdict.eluen == judged"
          },
          {
            "speaker": "eluen",
            "text": "规格就是规格。这座庭离不开光。",
            "when": "verdict.eluen == refuse"
          },
          {
            "speaker": "eluen",
            "text": "唯一之光，只能有一道。",
            "when": "verdict.eluen == contend"
          },
          {
            "speaker": "valda",
            "text": "外面总有更硬的。",
            "when": "verdict.valda == voluntary"
          },
          {
            "speaker": "valda",
            "text": "打得好。",
            "when": "verdict.valda == judged"
          },
          {
            "speaker": "valda",
            "text": "我哪儿也不去。",
            "when": "verdict.valda == refuse"
          },
          {
            "speaker": "valda",
            "text": "这座庭要的是最强的那个。",
            "when": "verdict.valda == contend"
          },
          {
            "speaker": "merca",
            "text": "给我在金湾留个小摊位。",
            "when": "verdict.merca == voluntary"
          },
          {
            "speaker": "merca",
            "text": "我宣布破产。（她眨眨眼）",
            "when": "verdict.merca == judged"
          },
          {
            "speaker": "merca",
            "text": "生意还没做完呢，客人。",
            "when": "verdict.merca == refuse"
          },
          {
            "speaker": "merca",
            "text": "这座庭，我出最高价。",
            "when": "verdict.merca == contend"
          },
          {
            "speaker": "sylvie",
            "text": "……他们长大了。我先走。",
            "when": "verdict.sylvie == voluntary"
          },
          {
            "speaker": "narrator",
            "text": "希尔薇没有说话，像一阵季风那样，化入了四季。",
            "when": "verdict.sylvie == judged"
          },
          {
            "speaker": "sylvie",
            "text": "……孩子们还小。",
            "when": "verdict.sylvie == refuse"
          },
          {
            "speaker": "sylvie",
            "text": "……让他们慢一点长大吧。",
            "when": "verdict.sylvie == contend"
          },
          {
            "speaker": "moira",
            "text": "让我写完最后的记录，再把笔交给一个凡人。",
            "when": "verdict.moira == voluntary"
          },
          {
            "speaker": "narrator",
            "text": "莫伊拉合上了书。",
            "when": "verdict.moira == judged"
          },
          {
            "speaker": "moira",
            "text": "从第一页。我一直在第一页。",
            "when": "verdict.moira == refuse"
          },
          {
            "speaker": "moira",
            "text": "这个故事需要一位作者。我来写。",
            "when": "verdict.moira == contend"
          },
          {
            "speaker": "narrator",
            "text": "冬至到了。大陆上七座天启碑同时亮起；同一时刻，神庭上方那片亮闪了一下，和那一天一模一样。"
          }
        ]
      }
